Z||000005||p4n1c||07-21-2001||10:42 PM||||'85 Cutlass or '85 Cutlass 4-4-2?<P>The 2.8l engine wasn't used in the Cutlass until 1988 in my car.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  The 1988 Cutlass Classic had a 5.0l V8.<P> <A HREF="http://home.att.net/~mrosamilia/" TARGET=_blank>http://home.att.net/~mrosamilia/</A> <P>That's for an '85 4-4-2.<P>------------------<BR>-=-=-=[ p4n1c ]=-=-=-<BR>1988 Olds Cutlass Supreme International<BR>2.8L MPFI V6/TH440-T4<BR>*Under Restoration*<p>[This message has been edited by p4n1c (edited 07-21-2001).]||||reg||1
